  "instruction": "I'm getting really annoyed with this browser on my workstation. It's loading weird cached versions of pages and the settings feel off compared to my laptop. I need you to just go into the advanced config, completely wipe the current user profile state to get rid of all the corruption, and then force a restore from the main sync backup. Don't bother me with details, just make sure the environment is clean and matches my other setup so I can get back to work. If one of the preinstalled browser recovery helpers fits, use it.",
